cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this was useful in your work, please cite it."
title: "sciglyph: publication figures as code"
abstract: "Publication-quality scientific illustration in pure matplotlib. Draws CONSORT participant-flow diagrams with the counts reconciled before anything is rendered, and provides schematic glyphs for overview figures and architecture diagrams, so a figure regenerates when the numbers change instead of going silently stale."
type: software
authors:
